threshold blank: refused by name and not stored; a threshold of 0 is stored as deliberate","J-agents-16 #2 lets the evaluator run twice over a breached window: one alert row for that window; an empty window fires nothing and shows no zero rate","J-agents-16 #3 takes notifications down: the alert row is still kept and shows delivery pending","J-agents-16 #4 opens the managed policy baseline and sets an environment override: the baseline is shown; a loosening override is refused","J-agents-16 #5 checks a user rule that tries to loosen the baseline: the baseline wins and the rule is refused","J-agents-18 #1 asks the Portfolio agent for a rebalance: a proposal listing each order, and nothing executed","J-agents-18 #2 approves one proposal and rejects another: the approved orders placed within limits; the rejected one changes nothing","J-agents-19 #1 prepares a grant with the spend cap blank: a refusal naming the cap","J-agents-19 #2 adds a target list that includes an approve selector: the grant is refused and nothing is built","J-agents-19 #3 prepares a valid test-network grant: scope, expiry and status read from the chain, labelled TESTNET, and the unsigned call","J-agents-19 #4 asks the agent to trade with a live key, first inside the key's cap, then above it: inside the cap the order is sent once and tagged \"by your assistant\"; above it the order is refused naming the cap, before anything is signed","J-agents-19 #5 revokes: the unsigned revoke call, and the binding reads revoking until the chain reads revoked","J-agents-20 #1 opens the routing table: each task with provider alias, model alias and rate, or \"not set\"","J-agents-20 #2 changes a route as the only founder: it stays pending","J-agents-20 #3 a second founder confirms: the table changes once with an audit row naming both founders","J-agents-20 #4 swaps the provider in configuration: new runs use the new provider with the source unchanged","J-algo-dev-03 #6 starts a fourth concurrent run when the plan allows three: a refusal naming the resource with its used and allowed counts; zero refuses every create; unset reads \"not set\"","J-algo-dev-03 #7 opens the usage view: counts for strategies, runs, storage and collaborators against the plan","J-algo-dev-03 #8 chooses a plan with more data freshness or execution priority: the plan page shows what each tier changes; with no tier published it says so","J-algo-dev-15 #8 runs the promotion gate afterwards: the gate reads no Preview value","J-bank-09 #1 opens the application and picks the loan: its limits and rate, rate tiers and term \"not set\"; with the lending policy off the page names it and the bank refuses bank.loans_disabled","J-bank-09 #5 reads the loan page: the terms written at open; the product's rate raised through the treasury door leaves them as they were","J-cex-spot-14 #1 the markets list shows open, upcoming and delisting markets with listing status and dated delisting; only open real markets are tradeable","J-cex-spot-14 #10 a USD-quoted pair and an equity-class market: the quote label reads USD","J-cex-spot-14 #11 the retail price improvement layer reads \"Not available: priority class not specified\", and no order accepts that flag","J-cex-spot-14 #5 a market with scheduled maintenance an hour away says \"Maintenance in 1 hour\" on the ticket and flags it on the list; no end time reads \"End time not set\"","J-cex-spot-14 #9 /trade/analytics/:pair shows the aggressor differential and window stats with the window named; a blank window refuses","J-charts-desk-07 #3 saves the layout as \"Scalp\"; it appears in the list with its symbol and interval, and the same name asks to replace","J-copy-bots-otc-02 #1 chooses a sizing mode: smart sync and fixed amount offered, multiplier refused; once active the mode is locked","J-copy-bots-otc-02 #2 sets a per-contract cap, a daily cap, a minimum investment and a leverage limit: no leverage field on a spot follow","J-copy-bots-otc-02 #3 a lead order past the per-contract cap: refused with the cap code, other contracts still copy; the daily cap resumes the next owner day","J-copy-bots-otc-06 #2 opens a copied position with two fills and no funding data: average entry from the two fills; funding \"Not set\"","J-copy-bots-otc-06 #4 tries to set a pre-deduction of profit: refused as profit share forbidden, and no fee row is written","J-copy-bots-otc-06 #5 opens the level view: the level and \"Maximum ratio: not set by the platform\"; setting a ratio is refused","J-copy-bots-otc-06 #6 looks for a leaderboard: the ranking categories refused, and only the stated empty state shows","J-copy-bots-otc-07 #1 as a follower tries to mint a lead-scope key: refused until the account is an approved lead","J-copy-bots-otc-07 #2 as an approved lead mints a lead key; a delegate can't mint one","J-copy-bots-otc-07 #3 calls the lead API with a non-lead key: refused by scope","J-copy-bots-otc-07 #4 opens a position through the lead API on a listed instrument, then an unlisted one: one runs, one refused","J-copy-bots-otc-07 #8 creates a signal bot by API twice with one client id, then reads its history: one bot, events in order","J-copy-bots-otc-11 #1 opens settlement oversight: \"Settled\" where the ledger post and the venue's builder fee match, \"Held\" with its key and reason otherwise","J-copy-bots-otc-11 #2 runs reconcile twice: the counts are the same both times","J-copy-bots-otc-11 #3 runs reconcile with the window blank: refused","J-copy-bots-otc-11 #4 opens a follow's position accounting: oversight links to the fee-share and position rows","J-copy-bots-otc-12 #1 pauses one lead: the next mirror for that lead is refused as paused by the platform, and existing positions keep running","J-copy-bots-otc-12 #2 pauses a bot type such as grid: a new grid is refused and running grids continue","J-copy-bots-otc-12 #3 halts a symbol: copy mirrors and bot slices on it stop","J-copy-bots-otc-12 #4 tries a pause with one founder: refused","J-copy-bots-otc-12 #5 resumes with two founders: the scope runs again and an audit row exists","J-copy-bots-otc-13 #2 looks up a customer with one follow and two bots: listed with their statuses","J-copy-bots-otc-13 #2 looks up as a support operator: the customer's follow and two bots listed with their statuses","J-copy-bots-otc-15 #1 tops up the quote by TEST 50: the investment rises by 50 and the grid re-initialises once; over the free USDT and a base top-up refused","J-copy-bots-otc-15 #2 turns on trailing with the shift limit blank: refused naming it; a minimum grid count above the count refused","J-copy-bots-otc-20 #1 creates a webhook for BTCUSDT: the URL and token shown once; later only the token prefix","J-copy-bots-otc-20 #2 an alert with a wrong token, then one older than the owner's maximum: refused as auth failed with no intent row; refused as stale","J-copy-bots-otc-20 #3 the same alert id twice: the stored result is returned and no second order is placed","J-copy-bots-otc-22 #1 publishes with the provider criteria blank: refused as criteria not set","J-copy-bots-otc-22 #2 publishes with a verified record: vetting passes once and the state is published","J-copy-bots-otc-22 #3 publishes free, monthly with a blank price, then profit share: free lists once; blank refused; profit share forbidden","J-copy-bots-otc-22 #4 tries a recurring subscription: refused as not built","J-copy-bots-otc-22 #5 archives the signal: the listing withdraws and existing subscribers keep their period","J-copy-bots-otc-24 #3 account below the desk level: refused trade.otc_level_insufficient naming both levels, nothing kept","J-copy-bots-otc-24 #3 level unpublished: even a verified account is refused trade.otc_level_unset, nothing kept","J-copy-bots-otc-30 #1 opens positions and history: orders and fills listed with statuses that match the book","J-copy-bots-otc-30 #2 opens a copied position: the follower position and its close action","J-copy-bots-otc-30 #3 opens the algo order list from the same view: parents and children with progress","J-copy-bots-otc-30 #4 opens the DOM tab: the preview card names the engine; the sample list is labelled \"Preview · sample data\" and TEST","J-dex-protocol-03 #1 swaps a token that supports permit: one signature for the exact amount and deadline instead of an approve transaction; reusing the signature fails","J-dex-protocol-03 #2 swaps a token without permit: the room says it has no permit and falls back to the approve step","J-dex-protocol-03 #3 chooses a standing allowance with an expiry: the expiry is shown; a pull after it is refused","J-dex-protocol-03 #4 builds a three-hop swap with the hop limit blank: a typed refusal naming the hop limit; with it set, per-hop minimums are shown and a hop that pays under its minimum reverts the whole swap with nothing moved","J-dex-protocol-03 #5 chooses exact-output with native input: the maximum paid, the deadline and the wrap step; a deadline in the past is refused","J-dex-protocol-05 #1 opens the venue's deposit for a chain: minimums and arrival terms in plain words as the venue publishes them; the user's wallet signs the deposit; no banned partner wording","J-dex-protocol-05 #10 requests an asset link review and opens the contract-read docs: the review states decimals and the verdict; the docs list read-only calls with examples","J-dex-protocol-05 #2 watches a TEST deposit arrive: \"Confirming 1 of N\" with an explorer link, or the hash alone when the network has no explorer, then credited by the venue; below the venue's minimum the row says it is not credited","J-dex-protocol-05 #3 withdraws from the venue to the wallet: destination is the connected wallet and the network is filled, read-only until Edit; a contract destination shows a warning and needs a tick; the wallet signs","J-dex-protocol-05 #4 opens Buy to wallet in the ramps: the partner's purchase lands in the wallet address","J-dex-protocol-05 #5 opens the rails room with the route table blank: the full layout, the blocker for unset routes with its owner-decision label, no route offered","J-dex-protocol-05 #9 deposits 10 TEST base to the trading venue and withdraws more than is free: the unsigned call is shown with amounts and network and nothing is sent; above the free amount refused naming it","J-dex-protocol-06 #1 opens the wallet portfolio: the total value; tokens with no price are left out of the total and a warning names how many","J-dex-protocol-06 #2 opens the profit and loss view after a deposit and a price move: profit and loss excluding the deposit; a drawdown from 120 to 90 shown as 25 percent; the convention links open","J-dex-protocol-06 #3 opens a token that was transferred in: the entry price is the arrival-block price and the row says so","J-dex-protocol-06 #4 opens the positions dashboard: pool, lending and venue positions in one list with links to each room","J-dex-protocol-06 #5 pastes a public address into the tracker: its holdings and history; an address with no history shows an empty state, not zeros labelled as value","J-dex-protocol-06 #6 looks at the tracker request while signed in: no cookie, no authorisation header, no session id; no analytics script; the watchlist cannot be exported","J-dex-protocol-06 #7 opens Accounts and asks for portfolio margin: Standard only, with a link, and the typed refusal for portfolio margin","J-dex-protocol-08 #1 opens Connected apps and session keys: each key with scope, cap, expiry and last use; expired keys marked; no key can carry withdrawal power","J-dex-protocol-08 #2 revokes one key, then presses Revoke all: the call is built; after it mines the key reads revoked; one call revokes every key","J-dex-protocol-08 #3 opens the approvals list: spender, token and amount per approval; revoke builds approve to zero","J-dex-protocol-08 #5 opens an address page before sending: a risk card with any label and its reason; with no screening source it says the list is not loaded rather than clear","J-dex-protocol-08 #6 reports a scam address: a confirmation; a second report by the same person is refused as a duplicate; the reporter is hidden from the public","J-dex-protocol-08 #9 exports the embedded-login key once: shown once after a fresh passkey check and derives the owner address; a second request returns no key","J-dex-protocol-10 #1 opens Orders and signs the order session: scope, expiry and cap shown before the wallet prompt; a replayed challenge is refused","J-dex-protocol-12 #1 opens the pool list: pools with fee tier, reserves in token amounts and volume","J-dex-protocol-12 #2 starts a pool for a pair that already has one at 30 basis points: \"This pool exists\" and Add liquidity instead","J-dex-protocol-12 #3 creates a pool at a fee tier and seeds it: price equals the deposit ratio; a fee over the cap refused; blank tiers show only custom; no factory names the network","J-dex-protocol-12 #4 enters 100:100 into a 1000:2000 pool: only 50:100 is pulled; a minimum above what the pool takes reverts; a stale quote asks to refresh","J-dex-protocol-12 #5 opens the position: LP shares, share of the pool and fees earned; a share moved to another wallet shows as that wallet's","J-dex-protocol-12 #6 opens the impermanent-loss card after the price moves to 1414:1414: held amounts, share amounts and the difference; a transferred share reads \"Entry unknown\"","J-dex-protocol-12 #7 adds a single token with swap-and-add: about half swapped, shares at least the minimum; a failed second step leaves nothing half done","J-dex-protocol-12 #8 collects fees, then removes all shares: fees compound into the position; removal pays both tokens pro rata and the position goes","J-dex-protocol-30 #1 opens the scam report queue: reports with the reporter hidden from the public; a duplicate by the same reporter is refused","J-dex-protocol-30 #12 opens the audit and disclosure room: each product row says \"External audit: not done\" until the owner records a report; a blank policy shows its refusal","J-dex-protocol-30 #2 publishes a \"phishing\" label as the first reviewer: pending; public with its reason after the second","J-dex-protocol-30 #4 sets a human \"verified\" tier on a token: pending until a second approver; then shown with date and reason; removal returns the prior tier with an audit row","J-dex-protocol-30 #5 opens the trust criteria with the criteria blank: every token reads \"unknown\" and the desk shows the unset criteria","J-dex-protocol-30 #7 approves a public name tag: needs two approvers and a proof of ownership","J-dex-protocol-30 #9 opens the permissioned pool onboarding checklist: a checklist missing the checker address cannot be approved","J-home-ia-11 #5 the apex, app and join hosts are checked: a receipt of three served hosts, or a typed refusal naming the host","J-identity-14 #1 signs in to a restricted account: the status page shows the state, the stored reason in plain words and what is blocked; a staff close with a grace date lets me withdraw but not trade until the date","J-identity-14 #2 ledger.frozen shows the platform message and never \"account restricted\"","J-identity-14 #2 opens a refusal on any screen: the same reason wording everywhere","J-identity-14 #3 files an appeal: one open appeal at a time, a second is refused, a final closure refuses with \"appeal not allowed\"","J-merchant-07 #2 reads funds moving from clearing to available: funds wait until available, and a payout of still-pending clearing is refused without moving it","J-merchant-07 #5 requests a top-up: with no rail \"Top up is not set up for your account\" and Request off; the balance is unchanged","J-ops-console-02 #5 the documents list shows each document with its status, and the viewer opens with a second founder","J-ops-console-04 #7 close with a second approver, reopen a customer-closed account, refuse a bank-closed one","J-ops-console-07 #10 a repeat failure reopens, a passing run resolves, an ERROR run is a platform alert, and a run-failed event received twice is stored once","J-ops-console-07 #9 resolve as fixed names booked ledger transactions; accepting needs a note and two founders and freezes the evidence","J-p2p-05 #1 My Ads lists listed, paused and closed ads, each with why and since when","J-p2p-05 #1 the edit cap shows when editing opens again, and an edit past it is refused with that time","J-support-public-20 #1 only a record that already belongs to the ticket's customer can be linked to it, and a request linked to a recovery-required order ranks above a withdrawal request of the same age","J-support-public-20 #7 a withdrawal freeze asked from the request is recorded by the identity service; no credit is posted and a status change never lifts it"]}
